ze: 15px; font-family: Georgia, serif; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><span style=\"font-family: Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">UTR</span></span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 15pt; font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia, serif; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><span style=\"font-family: Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Partnership name &amp; address/postcode</span></span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 15pt; font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia, serif; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><span style=\"font-family: Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Associated partners, etc via ‘Relationships’</span></span></li></ul></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 15pt; font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia, serif; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><span style=\"font-family: Georgia,serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Trusts</span></strong></span><ul style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;\" type=\"circle\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 15pt; font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia, serif; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><span style=\"font-family: Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">UTR</span></span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 15pt; font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia, serif; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><span style=\"font-family: Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Settlor/Trustee&nbsp;name &amp; address/postcode</span></span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 15pt; font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia, serif; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><span style=\"font-family: Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Associated trustees etc via ‘Relationships’</span></span></li></ul></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 15pt; font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia, serif; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><span style=\"font-family: Georgia,serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Tax Credits</span></strong></span><ul style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;\" type=\"circle\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 15pt; font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia, serif; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><span style=\"font-family: Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">As individuals above, plus joint claimant’s NINO if required</span></span></li></ul></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 15pt; font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia, serif; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><span style=\"font-family: Georgia,serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">PAYE</span></strong></span><ul style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;\" type=\"circle\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 15pt; font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia, serif; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><span style=\"font-family: Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">In addition to the above, the PAYE reference &amp; PAYE Office Code (employers only)</span></span></li></ul></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 15pt; font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia, serif; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><span style=\"font-family: Georgia,serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">VAT</span></strong></span><ul style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;\" type=\"circle\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 15pt; font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia, serif; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><span style=\"font-family: Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">In addition to the above, the VAT registration number</span></span></li></ul></li></ul><p style=\"font-family: Georgia, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Georgia,serif;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"font-family: Georgia, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Georgia,serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: normal; font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Georgia,serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">What happens after successful activation of the 64-8:</span></strong></span></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; font-family: Georgia, serif;\" type=\"disc\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 15pt; font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia, serif; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><span style=\"font-family: Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">It can take up to 24 hours for a 64-8 related to an Individual to appear on your HMRC client list.</span></span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 15pt; font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia, serif; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><span style=\"font-family: Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">It can take up to 72 hours for a 64-8 related to a Limited Company to appear on your HMRC client list.</span></span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 15pt; font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia, serif; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><span style=\"font-family: Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Note that you can still file the client’s SA100 or CT600 tax returns at any time.</span></span></li></ul><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 15pt; font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Georgia,serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;color:#444444;\">Potential Issues faced:</span></strong></span></p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;margin-left:undefined;\"><li style=\"font-family: Georgia, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 16px;\">1046 – <span style=\"color: rgb(49, 60, 71);\">Authentication Failure</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 16px;\">7001/7008 – Data does not match the error&nbsp;</span></li></ul>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\